SY_TALK("IsGPZhk68_g",[[0,["[missing start]"]],[1,["very anxious that Sahaja Yoga should be established."]],[4,["And the fourth thing he said that","there is going to be anniversary,"]],[8,["some fourth anniversary or something, of the U.N."]],[10,["And the gentleman who is in charge is that Muller fellow,"]],[13,["who is already suffering from something,"]],[16,["and he will definitely need My help."]],[18,["And he said that they, they are","going to have a spiritual dimension"]],[24,["to their celebration,"]],[27,["in which he wants Me to come","and give a lecture to them."]],[29,["And also he said I should go to UNESCO"]],[32,["and give a lecture there"]],[34,["and also I should go to Senegal to give a","lecture there and to establish Sahaja Yoga."]],[39,["Though he is a Muslim,"]],[41,["he believes in Sahaja Yoga very ardently."]],[42,["So all good things have come out of him."]],[45,["And this gentleman, Mr. Angel, whom I’ve met yesterday"]],[49,["was very positive and he said","he will try to get also a.."]],[54,["our Rustom here, with whom he will discuss","and other Indians will be discussed"]],[58,["and we’ll be able to find out something very positive,"]],[62,["because he got a tremendous","experience of realisation yesterday,"]],[66,["that he felt the cool breeze and all","that and he is a man of great learning."]],[71,["And I was very happy that he got","this realization and he was so good."]],[77,["So it seems that we are now about to take","a big leap into a new type of people,"]],[86,["who will bring Sahaja Yoga to a much wider","level and that is going to help all of us."]],[94,["At the same time I have to tell you, that we all Sahaja Yogis have to understand certain things, which are very important."]],[102,["Of course, I was very much pleased with the","way you had done this thing and all that."]],[107,["It’s very good."]],[108,["But certain things must be understood very clearly."]],[112,["And one of them was that some people,"]],[114,["of course, come to complain to Me also."]],[116,["You must know that, that they said that","the charges were rather too much for them,"]],[121,["for this programme and that the food was not sufficient"]],[126,["and some of them didn’t get sufficient food."]],[130,["All right, whatever it is."]],[132,["so from next time we have to remember that we must keep charges little lower, try to give sufficient food."]],[139,["Then I discovered that I was rather angry"]],[142,["with Christine and I told her that, “How","is it that the food was not sufficient?”"]],[147,["Then she said it was a caterer. But you","don’t have caterers; that's not proper."]],[151,["We shouldn’t have in Sahaja","Yoga any caterers or anything."]],[154,["There are Sahaja Yogis; they should cook."]],[157,["That’s the best way. There are so many of us"]],[159,["and we should not arrange with the","caterers because the caterers are,"]],[163,["you know, they make their own profits and they are not bothered whether everybody has got food or not."]],[169,["So that should not happen. Next","time we should have a more..."]],[173,["I mean, actually I could have cooked for you."]],[175,["I’m very good at cooking Myself, but I didn’t know there was a caterer or anything."]],[182,["So, this is what one has to see to it, that you should arrange things in such a way."]],[189,["And then another thing I have decided tomorrow to open an account in My name, in one of the banks here."]],[197,["And so that those who have to send","money for next year’s programme"]],[202,["should send it there directly, or","they can send it to Christine,"]],[205,["and Christine has to send all that and keep","a receipt of that and she has to tell Me."]],[211,["This is very important; one must understand."]],[213,["Secondly, I would say that you all should","have all the accounts properly written down."]],[218,["That is one of the most","important things in Sahaja Yoga."]],[221,["When I asked Christine, “What","about the accounts and all that?”"]],[224,["She said that there isn’t any","system like that existing."]],[227,["I said, “That’s something surprising.”"]],[230,["Because in London, though whatever it is, you know","that very well, every penny is accounted for."]],[237,["Even I am so meticulous about it, that if I","borrow even twenty p from you or anything,"]],[243,["I return it, see to it, because it haunts Me."]],[246,["And in the same way I think the","accounting is very important."]],[249,["One of the reasons why you suffer from money,","may be, that the accounts are not there."]],[254,["Must keep accounts, because I may not see the accounts,","but I may just have a glance at it and look at it."]],[263,["Actually, I would like to know what sort of","money is coming and what sort of money is going."]],[269,["It’s important. Is the Lakshmi","tattwa, which you must look after."]],[272,["It’s very important. It’s extremely","important. So next time when I come,"]],[276,["anything you do, you must have proper accounts."]],[279,["And just to show Me. That’s all."]],[282,["I am not going to deal with it, but I must","just see. My glances must be on that,"]],[286,["so that if there is any problem","of the money it can be solved."]],[292,["Like, we did, in North America","was a big mess, I must say."]],[296,["Last time. It was a very, very big mess,","and the whole thing took so much of money"]],[302,["and the way it was wasted, er, we must,","because there was no accounting system."]],[307,["If Patrick was to be put to the account system that, “We have to give account to Mother of every pie and everything that is important.”"]],[314,["There he could not have run","away with all that money."]],[316,["And despite that, he was a banker, because he didn’t","know where he was spending, what he was doing."]],[321,["And if you don’t keep that kind of an accounting, saying that, “This is Mother’s accounts,” you see, what will happen?"]],[327,["Money will slip out. You’ll over-spend money."]],[330,["That’s what exactly happened last time."]],[332,["And this time I don’t want it to be repeated."]],[335,["This is God’s money; this is His work."]],[337,["And we have to be very careful","with every paisa that we have."]],[342,["This is a very important thing","which people don’t understand,"]],[344,["and I was amazed when Christine told Me she has","no accounts of things and amazed how is it."]],[349,["She is the leader of New York","and she should have kept it."]],[353,["And I’m really sorry that she","had no accounts of anything."]],[356,["It really surprised Me."]],[358,["How could she do like that? And she knows; she has","lived in London and she knows what is to be done."]],[365,["This is another thing, because I must tell you","all these things, because you should not repeat."]],[369,["Then another very important","thing I must tell you:"]],[372,["I felt yesterday while the Puja was on,"]],[375,["I tried to raise your Kundalini. A terrible catch","of a very worst type on the Heart, Vishuddhi,"]],[382,["went into the chakra here."]],[388,["Now, that means there were some people","who were not fully Sahaja Yogis."]],[394,["So, it should never be done."]],[397,["Even in France, they did the same thing."]],[399,["And I told them, “You shouldn’t get half-hearted","people, just who have come for the Puja."]],[405,["If they are friends of somebody or something,","Puja, you have to be very, very cautious."]],[410,["Because it gives Me pain.” You don’t want to give","Me pain and don’t want to trouble Me, isn’t it?"]],[414,["I’ve come here to solve","problems, not to get into these."]],[418,["And it was really so painful","yesterday, you have no idea."]],[422,["But somehow I managed to take it out."]],[424,["So I would tell you, those people","who are not fully realised"]],[430,["who are not in doubtless awareness,"]],[432,["you must not have them for Puja."]],[435,["It gives Me trouble or they may go off."]],[437,["There was one fellow, I told him not to","come in, in France, and he became crazy."]],[442,["And then he will go to the jail, he","will go to the people and say"]],[445,["that, “Because of Kundalini Jagruti I got it.”"]],[447,["But to see to awaken","Kundalini is not an easy thing."]],[451,["And when everybody’s Kundalini is","rising, his Kundalini also may rise"]],[455,["and may have such a problem that we","cannot solve it. So you be careful."]],[460,["First of all, you should be really","very, very strict with people"]],[463,["that you should say, “You must all become."]],[465,["Unless and until you have","become, you cannot come to Puja.”"]],[467,["And I tell you, this works much better."]],[470,["Then everybody tries to be that;"]],[473,["everybody tries to race themselves."]],[477,["That, it’s a competition, sort of","thing, you know, they set into,"]],[479,["and they say, “We must do this.","Otherwise, how can it be?”"]],[482,["So they try to improve."]],[484,["But if you allow right, lovey-dovey","style, it goes on like that."]],[488,["It’s not that. And France, it’s one of them, which","has suffered so much because of this kind of thing."]],[494,["And I find in France then the wave","comes up and suddenly it drops down,"]],[498,["again comes up, goes down, because","there are no solid people there."]],[502,["So you have to create really very,","very, very, very solid people."]],[506,["That is important, and Puja","is only meant for them."]],[509,["Yeah, there may be only five, there","could be only ten; doesn’t matter."]],[512,["Not important to have many people for Puja."]],[515,["We can have it for programmes. So remember:"]],[518,["I’m telling you very clearly","anywhere. You want to have a Puja,"]],[521,["supposing now, say, in, er, San Francisco","or San Diego, you want to have a Puja,"]],[526,["anything of even of the photograph, then please do not","admit people to come in, who are not realised fully."]],[534,["Remember that. Never get them. You’ll have trouble, your children will have trouble,"]],[537,["your husbands will have trouble","and their bhoots will get into you."]],[542,["Because they’ll be so frightened as to face it,","that there could be very serious things happen."]],[548,["So remember my words: do not allow people who are","half-hearted, half-baked to come to Sahaja Yoga"]],[554,["in a way that is in the inner circle."]],[560,["Sahaja Yoga has three circles, as you know. One","is the periphery, where people come, go, like that."]],[565,["Second circle is where people","come and settling down."]],[568,["And third one where they are settled down."]],[570,["Only the third one can do the Puja. They only","have the privilege; it’s a special privilege."]],[575,["Everybody cannot have that privilege. All right?"]],[577,["This is one thing, then. Another","thing which really frightened Me was"]],[581,["the little child here. He","was very badly caught up."]],[585,["And now I don’t know why, but I must say","that you must have your vibrations corrected."]],[593,["May be something wrong that how","could you not feel the child."]],[595,["Means he would have gone mad the way","he was. You don’t know how he was."]],[599,["It was very dangerous. It could be with any other child."]],[602,["Why I am telling it openly? That it could","be with any other child that can happen."]],[607,["So be careful about your children. Be very careful."]],[610,["Always feel their vibrations. They,","you see, you are just trustees."]],[614,["They are My children."]],[616,["I was so amazed, I tell you. And he is so aware,","so intelligent and such a great soul like him."]],[622,["And he was suffering within himself, you see."]],[626,["Not only him; anyone of them could be","like that, anyone of the children."]],[629,["He’s just an example."]],[631,["It came to My mind yesterday,","and I was really very much upset,"]],[636,["very upset, because they","are My children, not yours."]],[641,["They are in your trust, and nothing","should happen to My children."]],[646,["Otherwise, I’ll take them away."]],[648,["You have to look after them.","Keep your vibrations all right."]],[651,["Remember that. Never get them. You’ll have","trouble, your children will have trouble,"]],[657,["See how they are. Look after them. It’s","not the responsibility of one person."]],[661,["It’s the responsibility of the whole centre."]],[663,["Like, Olympia got lost very much."]],[668,["And I was amazed how she got lost so much."]],[670,["I went to find out what was the reason,","how this child got into this thing."]],[675,["To Olympia, is such a great soul,","and I gave it to Gavin and Jane."]],[679,["And why this child is lost?"]],[681,["Now Jane is gone out there to learn some Sanskrit."]],[684,["There was one lady who tried to be","over sort of possessive of Olympia."]],[689,["She ruined her completely."]],[691,["So, but one thing about English is","that they all are joined together."]],[696,["All the children are there. They","always see them in the programmes."]],[699,["They are all the time there. Even if they are running, jumping or doing anything, even sleeping; doesn’t matter."]],[703,["But they bring the children to the programme."]],[705,["So the children are checked all the time."]],[708,["And they immediately informed Me about this."]],[711,["And we have now arranged her to go to","some other place, not with the parents,"]],[715,["but she will be staying with somebody","else. So there is no more problem."]],[719,["You see, you must know it’s very important."]],[721,["Because of their grace, we are getting so many things."]],[726,["They are great souls God has given us. They are great","saints God has given us. We have to respect them"]],[732,["We have to allow them to grow in Sahaja Yoga.","They should not be denied any opportunity."]],[737,["They should be brought to the","programmes, they should be tested by you."]],[741,["They should be looked after. They are in your trust."]],[743,["So if something happens, say,","in San Francisco to children,"]],[747,["I will definitely catch hold of someone in","San Francisco, why it has happened to them."]],[753,["All of you are responsible."]],[755,["It’s not only Judy, who is responsible for her children,"]],[758,["but all of you are responsible for these children."]],[760,["It’s not only that he is responsible for that child,"]],[763,["but everybody is responsible for that child."]],[766,["So children are a collective","responsibility; this we must understand."]],[772,["Otherwise, we’ll be in trouble because","if you do not look after the saints,"]],[777,["God is not going to be happy with us."]],[781,["That is very important for all of you to look after the","children in such a way that’s a collective responsibility."]],[789,["Every child must be looked after."]],[793,["Moreover, in England, after all,","because I’m there, I’m very alert."]],[798,["And sometimes I find it happened even","in Switzerland something like that."]],[806,["And I was amazed how one child was so caught up."]],[809,["And then we found that the father was","trying to play some tricks with him."]],[813,["And now he might go to jail, his father."]],[817,["But you see, you should be alert. What I am trying","to say is you should be all alert about it."]],[822,["This is your responsibility. This","is your collective responsibility,"]],[825,["and I would say that I will hold all of you responsible","if something goes wrong with My children. So be careful."]],[831,["They cannot suffer. They are not to","suffer. They have to enjoy life."]],[834,["They have to be happy children"]],[836,["and you have to see their needs and things and they","are a collective responsibility all of us have got."]],[841,["They are not the children of the","parents; you must understand that."]],[844,["They are your children, they are My","children, they are everybody’s children,"]],[847,["They are people’s children, they are important things."]],[849,["Till they are grown up let them be","here, then we’ll arrange their schools."]],[853,["We’ll look after them. They are very precious things,"]],[855,["extremely precious, all right?"]],[858,["And this is what I would like to tell you","that no child should suffer in My absence."]],[864,["I was quite disturbed because","he's such a great thing, Scott,"]],[868,["he’s such a great thing. First day I came","here I know. I was so happy to meet him."]],[873,["This is a great personality."]],[877,["But they should not suffer, you know. They will get","rid of it, but they’ll have to fight it out too much."]],[881,["If you help them, if you are alert, you","should see to whom they are talking,"]],[885,["what they are doing, where","they are going. Keep a watch."]],[889,["Be alert, because everybody is under attack."]],[894,["All the children are under attack.","All the satanic forces are there."]],[899,["You must take them to programmes. That’s one","thing you must do, because there it cleanses out."]],[904,["You should not be afraid of taking them to; even","if they sleep off or anything, doesn’t matter."]],[908,["Take them in sleeping conditions;","doesn’t matter. It’s all right."]],[912,["But they should be there. It works out.","They should be kept always very alert."]],[917,["Then the last thing that I have to tell you,","that all of you must clear out your vibrations."]],[923,["You all should become really sensitive."]],[925,["You should be able to see how much you have improved","in your sensitivity. That’s very important."]],[932,["You cannot play games with yourself."]],[935,["You have to be very sincere. You","all should know how far you are,"]],[939,["how far you are identified with your Spirit."]],[942,["Is very important, because you are yourself,","you are great seekers, of a very great value,"]],[950,["and you should not play about with yourself."]],[953,["Pay full attention to your Spirit."]],[955,["Pay full attention to your sensitivity."]],[958,["How far you are sensitive, how far you can feel","others, how far you can understand others."]],[963,["And if there is somebody you find is rather, er, bit","too much caught up, just tell Me on the photograph."]],[973,["I’ll look after that person."]],[975,["We’ll try to improve him or improve her."]],[978,["If she does not, then we’ll get rid of her."]],[981,["But don’t get caught up yourself;","don’t get into trouble yourself."]],[985,["You are saints. You are great things. You","are not to suffer anymore. That’s over now."]],[992,["Let Me suffer for you. You","don’t have to suffer at all."]],[995,["So you be careful about yourself."]],[997,["Now, know your personality, respect","your Spirit and rise in that."]],[1002,["And don’t in any way allow yourself to be","exploited, or to be tortured by anything."]],[1008,["Try to rise."]],[1010,["In Sahaja Yoga, as you know,"]],[1012,["the time as it passes you become","matured and matured and matured"]],[1016,["and, and that’s why we have everywhere, I have","appointed somebody as the leader of the thing."]],[1023,["One person has to be the leader. I cannot","contact all of you, I’ve said many a time."]],[1027,["So now, as we have one leader of every place,"]],[1031,["let us have everything done through one leader,"]],[1034,["because if I have to scold I can only scold","one person. That’s Christine in New York."]],[1038,["Or I can scold Danny in one place like","that, or I can scold some Alexander."]],[1045,["Now, say, in France they created a","problem for Me this Jean Francois,"]],[1050,["you see, he’s another mad cap, I should","say. I don’t know what to call him."]],[1053,["I never said anything to him, because","I don’t know French language"]],[1058,["and I don’t know. How will","I speak anything to him?"]],[1060,["He’s just saying that, “Mother said you are","a great leader. You are this. You are that.”"]],[1064,["He’s behaving just like Patrick. Can you imagine?"]],[1068,["Why will I say to him that, “You are like this”"]],[1071,["and if I say, supposing there must","be somebody to translate, isn’t it?"]],[1075,["But he is self-appointed person","there. I’m getting news about him."]],[1079,["That’s why we've decided not to go to Toulouse."]],[1081,["But this kind of a nonsense is","not going to work out at all."]],[1085,["This kind of, you cannot use Sahaja Yoga","for money. You cannot use it for power"]],[1091,["You can only use it for your ascent."]],[1093,["Like some people think, “I’ve","become the leader of this.”"]],[1096,["How can you become? And, “Mother told me.”"]],[1099,["Of all the things, I don’t know French,","a word. I know three, four words."]],[1105,["And he doesn’t know English."]],[1107,["How will I, how will I tell him","something, which I don’t know,"]],[1112,["and that nobody knows about I am telling him in","privacy or can I talk in privacy French language?"]],[1121,["Who is from there? From","Toulouse? Somebody has come? No."]],[1128,["No, no, no, nobody from Toulouse."]],[1131,["You are from Toulouse?"]],[1133,["Now what do you say of him?"]],[1137,["It was beautiful because for us","it was a big programme, I mean…And"]],[1145,["Loudly."]],[1148,["Well, it’s some strange thing because I was going big distance because I have many things and because to get here tonight."]],[1157,["Because at last tour I was too remembering for (unclear)"]],[1166,["And we have things from Paris, we have things","from Toulouse and we didn’t know how to manage"]],[1174,["and at last, things are at clear tonight. Thank you."]],[1180,["But I made it extremely clear,","of course, in English language"]],[1184,["but I, I made it so very clear that","it is Alexander with whom I deal."]],[1193,["Yes"]],[1195,["What do you say, Marie?"]],[1197,["It was extremely clear, but somehow he managed to work out the contrary as to what You said, and to tell other people."]],[1209,["I mean, this sort of a thing you should","refer back to Me. Thank God it is referred."]],[1213,["At least it won’t go too far."]],[1214,["Like, Patrick appointed himself,","self-appointment, the leader of the North America."]],[1220,["Just imagine. And I never knew."]],[1224,["Who told him, I don’t know."]],[1227,["And how much he troubled Me."]],[1229,["So anybody says like that, you refer it to","Me. Please refer it to Me, immediately."]],[1236,["And understand that these useless, egoistical","people are trying to be very funny."]],[1243,["Let him do what he likes in Toulouse, but you do","exactly what Alexander says, and I’ll see him."]],[1248,["I’ll talk to him. He was a","headache, in India, was he not?"]],[1255,["He was a big headache there and","suddenly now he becomes a leader."]],[1260,["I just don’t know. So please","don’t do all these things."]],[1263,["Try to keep one person in charge. I appoint","somebody by understanding that person."]],[1269,["Everything I understand, and then I appoint","that person. So don’t challenge Me, please."]],[1275,["None of you should do that. I","would request you not to do this."]],[1278,["So for all practical purposes, all North","America should work through Christine."]],[1285,["Christine has to inform Me. I cannot telephone","to all of you. Otherwise, I’ll become bankrupt."]],[1294,["If we have every telephone is one leader,","say, then what will happen to Me?"]],[1301,["So just keep to one person, all right?"]],[1304,["Is it all right, Steve? Do you understand that?"]],[1307,["You refer it to Christine, all of you. Refer it to Christine."]],[1313,["All right? She is the main person here."]],[1316,["And for others who are in their particular","places, like you are there in Boston,"]],[1322,["or somebody is there in Vancouver, like that,","in every place you have one person in charge."]],[1329,["But let her be in charge of all that."]],[1332,["I cannot telephone even to San Francisco, to San Diego."]],[1336,["So you must accept it,"]],[1338,["because she is the one who came all the","way from there to start Sahaja Yoga."]],[1342,["It is she who started this Sahaja Yoga, isn’t it?"]],[1346,["Like they told me that one Mr. Arizono","came here and you named the thing at,"]],[1352,["he has (unclear: named) even","today that’s how she came here."]],[1354,["So I know her. There’s nothing wrong","with her. Her vibrations are good."]],[1359,["She’s perfectly all right. She’s very sensitive."]],[1362,["If I find anything wrong with her I will correct her."]],[1365,["Now this is, say, simple plain English","language which I have learned."]],[1370,["But you do not read into words now,","anymore. It is simple as that."]],[1376,["I want to make it very clear, because I shouted at her and she was very nervous and she cried and wept and all that; happened."]],[1382,["Doesn’t matter. But I’ve shouted at","her, because she is responsible."]],[1386,["She has to assert herself and she has to see and accounts from Boston or from Vancouver should be brought to My notice."]],[1396,["They should be sent to India. I would","like to see how you people are managing."]],[1400,["So the one account will be for the future plans and","one account should be, you should manage ad hoc."]],[1409,["Like you want to have a, say, you want","to have a programme of your own."]],[1414,["For that you want to collect","some money; is all right."]],[1417,["But one should never start collections."]],[1419,["You know, in India. It’s very common in","the West. In India nobody does that."]],[1424,["Very common; we had a horrible time in London."]],[1427,["There was one fellow called","Peter Pierce. He came from TM."]],[1432,["And when I went away he","started a Building Account."]],[1435,["I don’t know which building it was. Without","the land, without anything, a Building Account."]],[1440,["And he had taken one house, that","Chelsham Road, and he started it."]],[1445,["And they collected five thousand pounds, and","no-one knows what happened to that account."]],[1452,["He took two thousand pounds from My husband."]],[1457,["Can you imagine such a thing? And within","three months’ time when I was in India."]],[1462,["But I don’t know why My","husband trusted him so much."]],[1467,["Then everybody gave him five","thousand pounds and two thousand;"]],[1471,["seven thousand pounds he had nicely with him,"]],[1473,["but the result was such that he became bankrupt."]],[1478,["And it was such a bad result that the","government asked him to get out of the country"]],[1482,["and he had to leave the country and now he","is in Africa in a very, very bad state."]],[1488,["Whatever he did for seven thousand","pounds has ruined him completely."]],[1494,["Imagine; he’s nowhere now.","I mean, he is gone away."]],[1498,["His wife and children he lost. Everything he lost. And he’s just all alone there in a very bad shape."]],[1507,["I’ve told you that it is God’s money,"]],[1510,["and these are saints. You cannot collect out of","saints something and spend it the way you like."]],[1517,["Ravanna used to do that way, and","you know what happened to Ravanna."]],[1522,["So one should never, because I do not take money."]],[1524,["That doesn’t mean that anybody should collect","money like that; seven thousands pounds..."]],[1529,["Danny knows all about it."]],[1533,["It’s very wrong."]],[1535,["You understand that this is God’s work."]],[1539,["And you cannot do anything like that."]],[1542,["This is very important. Otherwise,","money problem will never be solved."]],[1545,["It will never be solved. For","the time being you might feel,"]],[1548,["but then everything will be wasted."]],[1551,["So be careful on that; be very careful."]],[1554,["You have to be honest people."]],[1556,["Just now that Doudoudiem was telling Me","that in Sudan they are having a shariat"]],[1561,["that anybody steals even a, say,","a fruit, they cut the hands."]],[1567,["In Sudan; just imagine!"]],[1569,["Now we don’t want that kind of a thing to happen here,","that people should cut anybody’s hands or anything."]],[1575,["But it is a serious thing, because this","is God’s money; this is God’s work."]],[1583,["Has to be done with that","understanding and dedication."]],[1588,["Every paisa that was collected for even Indian tour","was recorded, put into things, every bit of it."]],[1600,["Yes, I’ll just have that little one.","All right? And thank you, thank you all."]],[1603,["But I think I speak for everyone here","that everyone will support Christine."]],[1608,["And I would think everyone here feels the same,"]],[1610,["that she’s the ideal choice to be","the leader of America, North America."]],[1614,["Thank you, thank you very","much, thank you, thank you."]],[1624,["And you don’t judge your leaders. Let","Me judge them. All right? Just let Me."]],[1629,["Try to, try to understand that our, most","of the instructions are coming from Me."]],[1634,["Because I shout at her and","she looks at Me like this."]],[1638,["So I said, “What are you doing?","Why are you not strong?"]],[1642,["(Break in this version of the talk. Recommences as She Mataji is talking about photography.)  Horrible!"]],[1648,["But must be something special about you","people, that you handle this subject like that."]],[1654,["Like today, you see, in the shop, the lady","said, “Oh, You, You had come with Your husband.”"]],[1659,["And I said, “Which one?”"]],[1664,["And that was Raja, Rajabhai Modi. I said,","“That’s My son. What are you meaning?”"]],[1672,["Imagine, what age I must have looked."]],[1675,["Just imagine. I was wondering what, what camera","she must have used to create such a nonsense."]],[1682,["Very nice lady, very nice."]],[1689,["Camera is Mahamaya."]],[1692,["(Shri Mataji unwraps a present.)"]],[1698,["Lotus in a lotus."]],[1707,["Is it American made?"]],[1709,["I don’t know Mother, I don’t know."]],[1716,["I see all that."]],[1722,["But is it made in America, no?"]],[1725,["I must see that because......"]],[1729,["Yes, beautiful. I would like to","see what porcelain Americans make."]],[1736,["Nothing there."]],[1737,["Beautiful porcelain, isn’t it?"]],[1744,["What an idea. It’s really beautiful porcelain."]],[1755,["Because in the shops you don’t find","any American porcelain anywhere."]],[1758,["It’s all Chinese or something."]],[1762,["So I wanted to know."]],[1765,["But I didn’t find any American porcelain anywhere."]],[1768,["I think they are not very much interested."]],[1773,["Nor did I find any crystal, American crystal."]],[1781,["I don’t think they make any. Do they?"]],[1783,["I don’t think so, Mother. I think most of Americans buy","Waterford crystal, made by the Irish, German, Yugoslav."]],[1793,["They don’t have any crystal, no?"]],[1796,["And the, and the, this also,"]],[1800,["this they don’t make. But the, the","crockery you use, is from where?"]],[1805,["Mainly crockery that the most","people like is English."]],[1809,["There are all kinds of Royal","Doulton, all that kind of thing."]],[1813,["Americans, there are also some china,","but I really don’t know so much of that."]],[1821,["I mean, they never had this in America?"]],[1826,["So what other hand-made things they do?"]],[1830,["I mean before they started this."]],[1832,["They must be doing some handwork."]],[1838,["Woodwork?"]],[1841,["That, that’s all right, that’s,","they are not Americans, in a way."]],[1845,["But to what handwork they","must have done before."]],[1850,["Can you say?"]],[1851,["Good carpenters, Mother. They are good carpenters","and they make nice interiors of houses,"]],[1855,["wood houses, wood floors, cupboards.","But they, they made a lot of …"]],[1862,["No, but I mean in decorativeness."]],[1865,["What do you say?"]],[1867,["In decorativeness, what","Americans have been making?"]],[1869,["Sculptures."]],[1870,["Sculptures?"]],[1872,["Yes, all plastic, Mother."]],[1874,["No, but in olden days they must be making."]],[1876,["Jewellery?"]],[1877,["Jewellery, they are best in the world."]],[1879,["Is it?"]],[1882,["Yes, Mother. They are the","best in the world, Mother."]],[1883,["Their designs are, they have the most","designs; Cartier, New York."]],[1888,["Is it?"]],[1889,["Excellent jewellers."]],[1890,["I didn’t find anywhere."]],[1896,["Mother, we have to go in the market. We have","to do the market. It’s not far from the hall."]],[1902,["No, no, what I am saying before all this started."]],[1905,["Yes. Beautiful, exquisite [unclear]","glass stone You will find there."]],[1910,["Glass made."]],[1913,["Crockery they make? What, which one?"]],[1916,["They made before."]],[1917,["Before, yeah"]],[1918,["And even now there are good potters, but they have a choice between making special things, which they have to get as it is very expensive."]],[1929,["Oh, hand-made must be expensive here, isn’t it?"]],[1932,["But there isn’t anything like in India or in Mexico where good quality things are available. (unclear)"]],[1939,["And the weaving they must","be doing in the olden days?"]],[1943,["You remember, Christine, you sent Me one, you’ve","seen… But that’s not American? That is Mexican."]],[1951,["Yes. Just American china. American","china and I haven’t mentioned that."]],[1957,["American china is there?"]],[1961,["In silver?"]],[1962,["Old silver, yes."]],[1966,["Old silver what?"]],[1967,["Old silver [unclear] in America [unclear]."]],[1974,["But there’s no demand for any."]],[1975,["What?"]],[1976,["There’s no demand for any. The masses","don’t demand it so there is no profit in it."]],[1981,["I didn’t follow."]],[1983,["Not enough demand for it, Mother, not enough people","want it. So they don’t produce too much of it anymore."]],[1989,["What is that?"]],[1991,["The... you know, aesthetic, [unclear] things like","that. The average person simply can’t afford it."]],[1997,["But what is that they produce actually?"]],[1999,["OK, although they do produce a lot of things [but","I think], they do heavy machinery production."]],[2004,["And there’s, there’s not much that goes into the","household items, so much imported, that is in plastic."]],[2011,["But not on these finer things, I think."]],[2015,["(unclear)"]],[2034,["Only in Toledo I found they were","making beautiful glass things,"]],[2039,["beautiful bells of glass and all","that, hand things, hand-made, Toledo."]],[2045,["Tiffan was the name of the place","where I went. It’s a village like..."]],[2049,["Murano."]],[2049,["And I was really surprised how","they were moulding into things"]],[2054,["and beautiful things they","were making out of glass."]],[2057,["Very nice."]],[2059,["Like bangles not there, but","something like this kind."]],[2069,["So there must have been lots of things of that kind here, because industrial development took much late, isn’t it?"]],[2076,["It came much later in life."]],[2080,["So they must have lived with, you see, some","sort of plates and things must have had."]],[2099,["Oven thing."]],[2106,["But that, too, was made in Poland."]],[2108,["I’ll try next time."]],[2112,["It’s like, you know, you want to","see something made in America."]],[2116,["You don’t find anything."]],[2119,["But if we are looking then in the assembly line which","is, was the, the exploiter of the mass production."]],[2125,["So we moved away from the er what","we would call cottage industry."]],[2128,["No, but sort of, we want to have,","say, something made in here."]],[2135,["Eh? What she’s saying?"]],[2138,["They make blue jeans."]],[2140,["They make blue jeans here."]],[2143,["Blue jeans."]],[2147,["The American hand-made things."]],[2149,["Blue jeans?"]],[2150,["The Americans have no taste."]],[2152,["Americans what?"]],[2153,["They have no taste."]],[2154,["I think they are the greatest,","that's why you are all existing."]],[2163,["They buy from all over the world. You","don’t know, you get Chinese goods here."]],[2168,["Every sort of good you can get in America","where you cannot find it anywhere."]],[2172,["All the best things there. I've even bought","all the old things from all over the world."]],[2178,["I mean, they have a good taste, no doubt."]],[2180,["They are the ones who got","the sense of antiques also."]],[2183,["They are the ones who introduced","this idea of antique."]],[2185,["I wouldn’t say that, but what I am","saying that there should be something."]],[2191,["Why I am asking you this question is this:"]],[2195,["everything I say has something behind it."]],[2201,["Now you tell Me why. Let’s see how","far you understand Your Mother."]],[2206,["Course we should be, we should be doing","something. We should be making handicrafts."]],[2211,["What is needed…"]],[2212,["No, no."]],[2213,["To create the beauty."]],[2215,["Not that. No, no."]],[2219,["Some sort of enterprise that","Sahaja Yogis can do together? So"]],[2223,["You are very near."]],[2227,["You see, why I am saying so…"]],[2230,["First I was thinking that we’ll come to America."]],[2233,["We’ll propagate; it will work out","very well, Sahaja Yoga, this, that."]],[2237,["But I found the people, you see, they get realisation;","then they are finished. They are no more there."]],[2242,["They do not take it that seriously.","They become frivolous or thing."]],[2246,["So how to settle them down? Because","the environment is very bad;"]],[2250,["environment is so bad that everything fizzles","out, you see; everything sort of fritters away."]],[2255,["Everything. I mean, the","seriousness of it goes away."]],[2258,["People just try to play with Sahaja Yoga, little","bit here and there. They don’t take it seriously."]],[2263,["So I thought of a plan which","I’ve told you before also,"]],[2267,["that in a big land in India, I was thinking of","starting a school for teaching them Indian crafts."]],[2277,["And that for that, whatever you are","not making here, we can make there."]],[2282,["But now I find that you are making nothing. So…"]],[2291,["So I was thinking of inviting people","from America to come down there,"]],[2299,["settle down there for three months","and learn a particular craft."]],[2302,["We can have about twenty-one","crafts I've found out,"]],[2305,["which are very, absolutely very, very Indian crafts and old crafts, and they can be taught very easily."]],[2313,["Within three months you can pick up the craft."]],[2315,["But by that, learning by that, you","won’t be able to do it yourself"]],[2320,["because it’s a, it’s, er,","labour, it’s very expensive here."]],[2323,["But what you can do is that,","supposing you like something,"]],[2327,["and now you have, now for","example this piece of silk."]],[2332,["Now to get it in the market it’s","easy that you go and get it."]],[2337,["But supposing you know the craft, then you can precisely say what sort of a thing you would like to have to sell it."]],[2345,["So you might have something","very unique things to suggest."]],[2349,["Because Indians whatever they will","send you whatever they have."]],[2352,["But your style, what you want","to have or what is you like,"]],[2357,["whatever you will be using that only","if you know the craft you can... Yes."]],[2362,["Mother, Radha was having an idea,"]],[2365,["because there is good leather in India which","is imported in form of raw material [unclear]."]],[2373,["Theoretically, tradition of leather was here in this country, and there’s definitely a market for it also."]],[2380,["That is just an idea."]],[2383,["I mean, you want to export."]],[2387,["You see, all such handmade things from","here cannot fetch you much money,"]],[2391,["because the reason is, it is very expensive."]],[2394,["But you can get it, cheaper things","from other countries, like Taiwan,"]],[2398,["this, that, is sending to you, but cheapish stuff."]],[2401,["But from India you can get genuine, good things."]],[2403,["That’s what I am talking about."]],[2406,["Leather work."]],[2407,["Leather work from India, made in USA. For the","American market. That’s what I am talking about."]],[2416,["But that is the taste part of it you","can tell us if you know the craft,"]],[2422,["isn’t it?"]],[2423,["If you don’t know the craft little bit, at least, you","won’t be able to exactly say or design it and say."]],[2430,["Another thing says, Indian furniture or","something, it’s quite good, hand-made."]],[2434,["Now if we send you the parts of the furniture,","if you know the craft, you can assemble it."]],[2440,["it would be much cheaper to send it here."]],[2443,["(short break)"]],[2446,["country, which you can first of all what I","would suggest that you must learn the craft,"]],[2451,["little bit, to understand what can be done.","Supposing now this is the thing in pieces."]],[2457,["Now you should know in this what we can do,","how far can we go, what colours we can use."]],[2464,["And then you exactly tell that","this is what we have to do."]],[2469,["Then the people can do it.","Then you can sell them here."]],[2471,["But Sahaja Yoga should never be","involved with any, any business."]],[2477,["I hope it is clear. No business should","be done under the name of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2482,["Hah, you can have your own cooperative","or anything between yourselves,"]],[2489,["but never, never use Sahaja Yoga, the","name, My name or anything for any business."]],[2496,["Sahaja Yoga is doing no business at all."]],[2499,["But by this kind of a thing, we’ll generate a better taste,","better aesthetics, better living standards in this country."]],[2510,["So I would suggest that when","we start this programme,"]],[2517,["I have to also get one more “Yes”","from you, because you are Americans."]],[2523,["And I think if that happens I will say that this,","My programme, has really reached its climax,"]],[2530,["because that’s one of the things","I wanted to know from you."]],[2533,["That when we have that place done,"]],[2537,["I didn’t want to have it into cement and all that,"]],[2541,["to make cement houses and all, but I wanted to make it","into ethnic style of huts, but comfortable and clean."]],[2549,["What do you say?"]],[2551,["Yes. Yes Mother."]],[2561,["That’s good. Then that can be","done very easily, very soon."]],[2566,["And we can start it this year, of course not, but","maybe next year we might start that kind of a school."]],[2571,["We have already got teachers, we’ve got","everything and we’ve got land also."]],[2576,["Can you imagine? And the land will be near some river","where you can jump into it every day, every minute."]],[2589,["That would be nice near a river. We should have","a big place where you all can enjoy yourself."]],[2595,["Anything else? Any other suggestion?"]],[2601,["Cooking classes."]],[2603,["Yes, Indian cooking. We would","like to know Indian cooking."]],[2606,["One of them is that. There are twenty-one crafts."]],[2611,["Indian cooking, Indian sewing."]],[2616,["Sewing also. Embroidery, then housekeeping."]],[2631,["Husband management."]],[2644,["How Indian women manage their husbands!"]],[2648,["Without arguing, without fighting."]],[2651,["The husbands, just, you see,","never allow them to cook."]],[2658,["No cooking will be allowed to be learned by men."]],[2664,["So the women will know only the cooking and","men will have to come home to have their food."]],[2681,["That’s how we manage our husbands."]],[2685,["Best way to manage your husband is","through his stomach and tongue."]],[2691,["Every man is a child as","far as this is concerned."]],[2694,["Children marketing, Mother."]],[2697,["Children. They are all children as","far as food is concerned, you see."]],[2701,["So, if you know how to make Indian food, I tell you","there are so many permutations and combinations,"]],[2707,["that they look forward. You see, every day","you don’t have the same stuff in India."]],[2712,["The repetition may come after two, three days or","maybe after two, three years if you are an expert cook."]],[2718,["It’s like that."]],[2722,["So… and decorations of the","house, everything we’ll have it."]],[2729,["Like stone carving."]],[2731,["Stone carving, wood carving, ivory","carving and there are other carving also."]],[2739,["We have what you call, yes, this is a","silversmith, goldsmith, that is there."]],[2747,["And also weaving, weaving of different types."]],[2753,["What else? There are twenty-one,","we found out, which are very easy."]],[2759,["What about painting?"]],[2760,["Aaaa?"]],[2761,["What about painting?"]],[2762,["Painting."]],[2764,["In the village I think it’s called","Madhubani, if I’m pronouncing that correctly."]],[2768,["I beg your pardon."]],[2770,["Madhubani, I’ve read in a book about a village or area","in India where almost all of the women learn to paint."]],[2779,["Oh, that’s in the north."]],[2781,["Yes, I gave you paintings out of","that. You didn’t get the paintings?"]],[2785,["Those who got married, in their house, there?"]],[2788,["You have one?"]],[2789,["We have one, somewhere. You have given Daniel","one, I think. We have it, here. I’ll show them."]],[2794,["Yes, I see. We have, the whole village","will be doing carving of the wood."]],[2800,["Then one village will be doing the inlay work,"]],[2802,["one village will be doing painting work, like that."]],[2804,["We can do that."]],[2806,["That’s something very, very","remarkable that painting business."]],[2812,["Not one village but quite many."]],[2817,["Madhubani,"]],[2820,["Madhubani painting, yes. And then also","this, what you call knitting and cane work."]],[2828,["Oh, beautiful!"]],[2830,["Canework,"]],[2833,["canework and making mattresses, chatais,","what you call, mats, and things like that."]],[2839,["Canework; that all can do."]],[2841,["inlay work, inlay work, inlay in wood, inlay","in under stone, inlay; all that you can learn."]],[2850,["Could be many things, much many more like the,","you see, these things also we make very well,"]],[2856,["very decorative."]],[2857,["Mandapas, we call them.","Extremely beautiful, they are."]],[2860,["Very well done."]],[2865,["Also many things we can learn it."]],[2871,["Silver is very, very, nice, but in India they","don’t make silver utensils out of sheets."]],[2878,["They make it out of, what you","call them, aaa...."]],[2883,["I don't know."]],[2884,["moulded, moulded one."]],[2886,["I’ll have the tea I think.","it has gone cold or not?"]],[2890,["It is moulded."]],[2892,["And wax."]],[2893,["Wax work?"]],[2894,["And in wax and then they melt it like for the casting."]],[2898,["Casting."]],[2899,["And also, they do wax work","on the saris and clothes."]],[2906,["That’s very… what they are called? Batik."]],[2910,["They do a batik also on the leather work."]],[2912,["Leather work, batik, very","beautiful leather. Batik work."]],[2915,["But only thing is when you will be there you will be","as it is that the American taste, as he’s saying."]],[2921,["We’ll have something with the American taste."]],[2923,["Then we are very good at doing certain","things which are very, very expensive here;"]],[2929,["is making frames out of","silver, gold, out of, er, horn."]],[2939,["Horn, we are very good at horn carvings."]],[2942,["Out of horn you can make","so many things in India"]],[2946,["And then this metal work,"]],[2949,["brass."]],[2952,["All kinds of brass work. Glass work!"]],[2954,["We have tremendous glass and","our crockery also is very good now."]],[2960,["Our crockery is now being exported to Russia."]],[2964,["And also our crystal."]],[2969,["Then we have, what you call, all kinds of","glass work; beautiful glass work we have."]],[2976,["Beautiful animals and things","they make, beautiful."]],[2982,["(Shri Mataji is shown something.)"]],[2990,["How did you get it?"]],[2991,["I don’t know. I just find","it somehow and it’s there."]],[2997,["Yes, they are very different, aren’t they?"]],[3005,["She doesn’t want to leave you."]],[3014,["Shanti."]],[3015,["Is she still with Me or with You?"]],[3018,["Somewhere."]],[3021,["Shanti."]],[3028,["Then also we have our temples."]],[3031,["How we make our temples, it’s","very interesting, you know."]],[3034,["We remember that, its","stone carving, Mother."]],[3036,["Stone carving. No,","that’s you carve stones."]],[3040,["Then the carved stones are put in such a way that they, the complete pillar is made, you see, out of that."]],[3048,["But that is also very big art."]],[3050,["Sometimes the carved stones are such that you cannot make out whether it is one stone or there are many pieces."]],[3058,["They are great."]],[3061,["So we can learn so we can","make some temples here."]],[3064,["Yes, you can, you can have."]],[3068,["But what I would say that, it would be better that you, you learn it and tell them what do you want, you see."]],[3075,["Like now we have lot of","carving, but say, Greek style."]],[3078,["Or something, you have","four dimensional things."]],[3082,["That they don’t do. You can tell them, “We","want four dimensional.” They can do it."]],[3087,["Work it out on stone or marble,","anything you want to do."]],[3092,["And toy making."]],[3093,["What about mirror work?"]],[3094,["I beg your pardon."]],[3095,["Mirror."]],[3095,["Mirror work? Quite a lot. That’s","in embroidery and all that."]],[3099,["And also..."]],[3100,["Oh Mother, I don’t know, elephant and","things we can hang on Christmas tree"]],[3103,["Yes, yes. That is, that is made there."]],[3105,["That’s quite a lot; that’s","quite a lot you can do."]],[3108,["Plus you see what they do, it is a mirror","work on the clothes and things like that,"]],[3113,["that also quite a lot."]],[3114,["There is the whole country is","doing it;"]],[3118,["the whole country is. You won’t","know how, where to stop it."]],[3127,["We make the beautiful","Ganapatis and all other things."]],[3130,["Especially from Nagpur from where I","come, they make the best Ganapatis."]],[3135,["There’s a kind of a... Now here this clay that","you use so expensive; in India is very cheap."]],[3144,["Only thing we do not have proper firing."]],[3146,["But we have crockery; we have got,","what you call that, er, porcelain,"]],[3154,["kind of a porcelain, beautiful."]],[3158,["And we have ceramics; all","these three things we have."]],[3161,["But they are to be properly understood","in Indian style. It’s very different."]],[3165,["Like I went to Japan. I said, “I want","to, I’ve come to see some ceramics.”"]],[3170,["I went to one place where they were","making some ceramics with their hands."]],[3175,["So they said, “Here they are all on leave.”"]],[3177,["I said, “Really? They are on holidays?” They said, “No, no, they have now gone to India to learn ceramics.”"]],[3182,["So I looked at them. I said,","“From where do you learn?”"]],[3187,["Then they told Me the place","from where they learn"]],[3190,["and that place is so close","to My husband’s place."]],[3192,["When I went there I went to","see that, and it was there."]],[3198,["Like that, so many, because, you see, we","haven’t got machinery so we, our hands work out."]],[3204,["Kashmir work is, papier-mâché","work is so much, so much."]],[3215,["There’s no end to it. Everything","they use it for making."]],[3219,["They never allow any lines to go straight."]],[3222,["It has to be worked out into something."]],[3226,["Out of these also they make tent, tent things."]],[3232,["But you see, that is how one should live","with the matter, to make it beautiful,"]],[3238,["and that can be brought","here for no money at all,"]],[3241,["quite cheaply, compared to these people are","making so much money and they have no taste also."]],[3246,["But if you can get something like that, you can sell it for","a cheap price and people will have better taste to live."]],[3254,["There I have been investigating it, the import","laws, and they are rather strict in this country."]],[3266,["I’m not sure what they would consider, if they would consider things that are in pieces coming from another country"]],[3272,["(unclear)"]],[3275,["Certainly four things are heavily tariffed and controlled."]],[3281,["So there is, export is high."]],[3283,["(Unclear) If hand-made, is a labour by the","country which [unclear] no taxes at all."]],[3288,["You see, if it is hand-made","in America, no problem."]],[3292,["No tariff at all. True."]],[3293,["You see, if it is hand-made, even","in England you’ll be surprised,"]],[3296,["such a conservative country.","If it is hand-made, nothing."]],[3301,["You see, they want to enrich their country","because they don’t have hand-made things."]],[3305,["Ha, for other things they do it."]],[3308,["Not only that, but anything that is more than","hundred years it’s absolutely free of cost."]],[3314,["Anything hand-made!"]],[3317,["You just find out; you’ll be amazed."]],[3321,["Otherwise, you will have","no hand-made things here."]],[3327,["We’ll be all moving in plastic bags."]],[3333,["Horrible! Horrible picture!"]],[3337,["To change all that, to bring in Sahaja Yoga, we have","to have natural things, beautiful things around us."]],[3343,["And it’s very simple to do,","to get all these things here."]],[3347,["But also then their taste will develop."]],[3349,["People will think more.","You see, you have brains,"]],[3352,["you have better aesthetics and you can suggest","better things which Indians may not have."]],[3360,["But that you can suggest and get things;"]],[3363,["Knitted!"]],[3364,["Knitted, hand-knitted clothes, hand-knitted","shirts, hand-knitted things, you can get very well."]],[3371,["Cotton, beautiful cotton!"]],[3376,["Now here you get very good cotton, but that cotton","is to be stitched into proper dresses and things."]],[3382,["Children’s wear."]],[3383,["Children’s wear? Oh, beautiful children!"]],[3386,["We have one lady, she’s making such","beautiful children’s wear, Mrs Nigham,"]],[3391,["but she says, “The market here is so","great that we don’t want to export it.”"]],[3399,["Just imagine. But now supposing, I mean, if","there are some people like you help her out,"]],[3404,["then she might give you something for export.","For she makes.... she says she has no time."]],[3409,["Many people have stopped exporting."]],[3411,["The market is so great in India itself."]],[3415,["Handicrafts!"]],[3421,["And you can give lots of","suggestions, lots of suggestions."]],[3425,["Like, say, now you have got this brass."]],[3429,["Now, how to keep it shining all the time?"]],[3431,["You might be able to give","some suggestions also."]],[3435,["We have lots of treatments, lots of","chemical treatments to make them shine"]],[3437,["Ha, that’s what we don’t have."]],[3441,["Also, like, we don’t have","good buckles in India, say."]],[3445,["Really, we don’t have. We don’t","have proper glues in India."]],[3449,["And we don’t have zips. You should export your","zips from here and get a, get a purse instead."]],[3457,["Yes, we don’t have. Many","things we don’t have there."]],[3461,["Proper, what you call, today, this, Marie showed","Me something in which you can fix a picture."]],[3468,["That’s such a nice, beautiful,","er, latch. We don’t have."]],[3474,["In India we don’t have such nice latches."]],[3481,["So many things!"]],[3484,["You can also export from here your taps, but I don’t","know; American taps are such that they don’t fit anywhere."]],[3492,["Everything is so funny here."]],[3494,["Your, er, this thing, electrical is hundred and ten."]],[3500,["It doesn’t fit anywhere."]],[3503,["Hundred and ten!"]],[3508,["Everything is like that. You can’t","buy anything electrical from here."]],[3512,["Your television is  different."]],[3514,["You cannot use the cameras that you use here."]],[3520,["How is the videos?"]],[3522,["You cannot use for videos, you see."]],[3525,["We cannot use your tape recorders."]],[3528,["Nothing electrical we can use."]],[3530,["So what a bulk is gone."]],[3531,["See, what will you export?"]],[3534,["I mean, your government is seeing to","it that nothing should be exported."]],[3542,["What will you export then?"]],[3544,["Electrical goods are out.","Now take another. Your cars:"]],[3548,["your cars are funny. Nobody wants it,","because one reason: they are too big."]],[3555,["But [unclear] it started here. I don’t understand how the rest of the world got out of sync or we got out of sync....."]],[3563,["That’s the thing with them","is, that’s the main thing."]],[3566,["It is that they want to","do something different."]],[3570,["Can I have My sweater please?"]],[3572,["They always want to do something different."]],[3575,["And in doing so, they have alienated themselves,","separated themselves from the rest of the world."]],[3584,["That’s the point is. They, they just","don’t want to do the way others can do."]],[3594,["I mean, a simple thing like a sweater, you see."]],[3596,["I wanted to buy one for My son-in-law."]],[3599,["It’s all funny style. It’s","not one that he would wear."]],[3602,["Whatever generally people wear, is not","available here. They were all English."]],[3608,["Otherwise, with a neck like","that, with a collar like that."]],[3613,["And the frocks you try to buy for your","children, they’ll have all funny things."]],[3618,["All is funny things they make."]],[3621,["I went to see the socks."]],[3624,["Socks are colours like,"]],[3627,["what you call them,"]],[3630,["what colours, shocking pink!"]],[3632,["Now imagine Me wearing a shocking pink."]],[3638,["Ha, then we went to buy, I mean it’s like","that, went to buy what you call them, goggles?"]],[3644,["The ladies’ goggles, all of them, are like","this. You’ll like a witch, you know."]],[3648,["All of them having like this. This is ladies’."]],[3651,["All of them had some sort of a white stuff or a golden","stuff or anything coming out up to this point."]],[3658,["I mean, if you wear, it is for","the witches to wear like this."]],[3662,["And no Indian woman would","wear a thing, I don’t know."]],[3666,["What to buy? Then I didn’t buy."]],[3667,["Same with the watches."]],[3669,["Everything big problem,","you know. It’s odd-looking;"]],[3672,["nothing decent."]],[3675,["It’s odd-looking. I mean, simple things like this."]],[3679,["What is the....?"]],[3681,["Traditional style. The traditional styles you can’t","get. They import them from England and Switzerland."]],[3686,["No, no, all right, I don’t say traditional it","should be, but something near decency, isn’t it?"]],[3691,["Now supposing you have a sweater like this. I mean,","you are not some king or someone to walk like that."]],[3699,["It looks so funny, na?"]],[3702,["All funny looking, I mean to say."]],[3707,["Mother, and they sell clothes that are","already worn out. So when you buy them"]],[3711,["Ha, with holes."]],[3712,["Yes!"]],[3717,["It is I can’t understand."]],[3733,["Anything that we found that was","really something, we can say,"]],[3737,["it’s traditional or something","that anybody can wear decently,"]],[3740,["was all English.  All English!"]],[3745,["Or Polish or anything else but American!"]],[3751,["Either the pants would be baggy or would be so","tight that once you wear it you cannot take it out."]],[3768,["Very difficult."]],[3771,["That’s why they have junks here. Nobody","can take it and nobody can purchase it."]],[3785,["Same with jewellery, I must say."]],[3787,["Jewellery is also quite odd, you know."]],[3789,["In the ear such big, big things you","know, hang from here up to here."]],[3794,["There are jewelleries also very funny and queer."]],[3796,["The original jewellery they used to make","was beautiful but they stopped making it."]],[3801,["They import all the stuff now."]],[3807,["I don’t know what to say, but really I feel"]],[3810,["that people must come to some universal understanding","in this country which stands for universality."]],[3818,["It’s, is the centre of collectivity."]],[3824,["Then you go on seeing people also like that."]],[3827,["They become very queer. There’s","no universality in them."]],[3834,["Somebody will talk like this;","another will talk like that."]],[3836,["Every time you have to adjust","your ears to every person."]],[3841,["That’s not good."]],[3843,["I mean, if you have to have rapport with the whole","world, you must have certain norms, isn’t it?"]],[3849,["And this country should create","norms. On the contrary, I would say."]],[3875,["In these, I think twenty-five years or so,"]],[3879,["they have deviated so","much (teacup falls over)"]],[3881,["in individualism and all that. It’s too much."]],[3883,["Now this is also a very","small cup, American style."]],[3889,["It’s all right; doesn’t matter."]],[3890,["Can you get something to clean?","It’s rather a small cup for a tea."]],[3895,["It’s all right. You just bring some cloth."]],[3897,["It’s all right. Doesn’t matter. Nothing to be worried"]],[3899,["So this is what happens."]],[3902,["And one has to bring it to that normalcy."]],[3908,["I don’t know when will be they think about it?"]],[3913,["It’s all right. That’s all right. We just only,","you have to use a little wet cloth for this,"]],[3918,["because the tea takes....,","the silk might get it."]],[3921,["Just wet, wet it and little bit water."]],[3930,["So,"]],[3933,["I would suggest that when you people try to do something,","like even having a video now, we had a problem."]],[3941,["I said, please try to buy something","in which you’ll also have VHS,"]],[3947,["because now we can’t make for","Americans something separate."]],[3950,["And you will be missing all the videos."]],[3952,["We are, Mother."]],[3954,["You are missing it."]],[3956,["Now, to get one like that , it's","very cheap here in the market."]],[3960,["because I know that it doesn’t cost. So","now if you have to buy any television,"]],[3965,["buy that one, which has got both the, isn’t it?"]],[3968,["I think this Doctor Bhaava has bought one."]],[3973,["Aaaa?  (unclear). Yes!"]],[3976,["And it cost?"]],[3977,["Three, three hundred, three hundred dollars."]],[3986,["Yeah!"]],[3987,["I mean, most of the recording","is done by this particular thing."]],[3992,["So if you buy that now, I mean,","instead of buying anything else."]],[3997,["Can you? No, is it, is it little bit wet?"]],[4001,["It should be wet."]],[4004,["Yes, water. Little water on it; that’s all."]],[4007,["Bring some water on it; that’s all."]],[4009,["If you buy something like that, then wherever we have","the films, anywhere in the world,"]],[4015,["you can see it. Except for America, everybody can see it."]],[4022,["A very big problem!"]],[4025,["And to adopt anything from this","one to yours is very difficult."]],[4030,["But more difficult it is from yours to this."]],[4035,["Is even more difficult!"]],[4053,["He’s so playful. Let him play,"]],[4056,["let him play."]],[4070,["He’s feeling shy."]],[4071,["He's hiding from us."]],[4081,["Hello, Bhima, I can see you."]],[4083,["Aaaaaa!"]],[4089,["Are, baba, so much problem.","Just, just a little wet cloth."]],[4097,["It’s too much. Just have it wet cloth.","She's rubbing. She knows. Just a wee bit."]],[4102,["Here it is wet."]],[4103,["Yes, it’s all right. Anything will do."]],[4106,["Just, just a wee bit it stands."]],[4109,["It takes out the stain; that’s all."]],[4112,["It’s a... you see, always there’s a stain with this."]],[4116,["Clean, ha."]],[4117,["A bigger cup would be better,","not such a small one."]],[4122,["You see, normally they use that","small one for the coffee, isn’t it?"]],[4126,["North India, America, I don’t know."]],[4132,["There, it’s faded, already."]],[4143,["No, it is, it's there a little bit, already there."]],[4149,["You can take it out there."]],[4154,["The stain is there also."]],[4156,["Aaaa?"]],[4156,["It is a half-cup, like a half-truth."]],[4159,["But you don’t have it anywhere in","the world, one like that, you see."]],[4164,["It’s for a coffee after dinner."]],[4167,["That’s a wee bit."]],[4169,["But for tea they don’t have it. But you see,","in America you have to accept everything."]],[4183,["Does soap help?"]],[4186,["No, just water, cold water."]],[4188,["Yes. Is done, I think."]],[4191,["One little bit there."]],[4193,["And a bit there."]],[4195,["Yes, I think so. He is very good at taking."]],[4199,["Oh, Danny is another, a real Englishman."]],[4203,["He is so resourceful; you have no idea."]],[4205,["Oh, he’s extremely resourceful."]],[4215,["He is so resourceful man, I have to","come across another person like him."]],[4220,["He’s like Jeeves, you know."]],[4224,["Leave it to Jeeves; leave it to Jeeves."]],[4230,["Extremely resourceful."]],[4248,["Thank you."]],[4255,["He’s very straightforward and very resourceful."]],[4259,["(More tea is offered.)"]],[4260,["Ah, this is a proper cup."]],[4280,["Ha, that’s it. That’s it, very sweet. Thank you."]],[4288,["Very good, thank you."]],[4295,["English put the milk first."]],[4301,["But that’s not very logical."]],[4306,["You see, if you put the milk first, then you","don’t know how much milk you need, isn’t it?"]],[4314,["Isn’t it? Not very logical, I think."]],[4317,["You must put first the tea and then the","milk; you know how much it is to be put."]],[4329,["But they are competing with you in everything."]],[4332,["Specially now they have produced a special one thing","in which they have got the highest marks, is punks."]],[4347,["That’s a good idea to keep the left Agnya","open like that, eh?"]],[4353,["That’s a good idea."]]]);
